@startuml
title 酒店预订系统 UML组件图 分层与模块依赖
skinparam componentStyle rectangle
skinparam shadowing false
top to bottom direction

actor "顾客" as Customer
actor "酒店工作人员" as Staff
actor "平台管理员" as Admin

package "表现层" {
  component "顾客页面与请求入口" as CustomerUI
  component "酒店页面与请求入口" as StaffUI
  component "管理页面与请求入口" as AdminUI
}

component "独立定时任务工作进程\n扫描数据库中的到期记录" as Scheduler

package "业务层 同一应用代码" {
  component "M01 账号与权限\nAuthService / AccessPolicy" as Auth
  component "M02 酒店与房型\nCatalogService" as Catalog
  component "M03 库存与房价\nInventoryService" as Inventory
  component "M04 房源查询\nSearchService" as Search
  component "M05 预订与订单\nOrderService / OrderPolicy" as Orders
  component "M06 入住与退房\nStayService" as Stay
  component "M07 履约异常\nIncidentService" as Incident
  component "M08 系统内通知\nNotificationService" as Notice
  component "M09 订单与余房统计\nStatisticsService" as Stats
  component "M10 操作日志\nAuditService" as Audit
}

package "数据访问层" {
  component "各模块Repository\n共享事务上下文 UnitOfWork" as DataAccess
}
database "PostgreSQL\n业务数据 历史 通知 日志 请求记录" as DB

Customer --> CustomerUI
Staff --> StaffUI
Admin --> AdminUI
CustomerUI ..> Auth : 当前身份与授权
StaffUI ..> Auth : 当前身份与授权
AdminUI ..> Auth : 当前身份与授权
CustomerUI ..> Search
CustomerUI ..> Orders
CustomerUI ..> Notice
StaffUI ..> Catalog
StaffUI ..> Inventory
StaffUI ..> Orders
StaffUI ..> Stay
StaffUI ..> Incident
StaffUI ..> Stats
StaffUI ..> Audit
AdminUI ..> Catalog : 酒店管理
AdminUI ..> Incident : 查询 通知 协调
AdminUI ..> Audit

Search ..> Catalog : 查询资料
Search ..> Inventory : 查询价格与余量
Orders ..> Auth : 核对操作人和权限
Orders ..> Catalog : 核对有效资料
Orders ..> Inventory : 预留 复用 释放
Orders ..> Notice : 保存处理结果
Orders ..> Audit : 保存成功事件
Stay ..> Orders : 入住 未到店 退房命令
Incident ..> Orders : 受权订单命令与查询
Incident ..> Inventory : 工作人员停售
Incident ..> Audit : 记录协调与处理
Stats ..> Orders : 只读查询
Stats ..> Inventory : 只读查询
Catalog ..> Audit
Inventory ..> Audit
Auth ..> Audit

Scheduler ..> Orders : 确认超时
Scheduler ..> Stay : 未到店 延迟退房提醒

Auth ..> DataAccess
Catalog ..> DataAccess
Inventory ..> DataAccess
Orders ..> DataAccess
Stay ..> DataAccess : 提醒标记
Incident ..> DataAccess
Notice ..> DataAccess
Audit ..> DataAccess
Scheduler ..> DataAccess : 只读候选扫描
DataAccess --> DB

note right of Orders
  统一校验角色、状态、版本和时间
  订单、逐晚库存、成功日志及对应通知
  共享同一事务，提交后才返回成功
end note

note right of Auth
  所有业务服务均执行当前权限与数据范围校验
  为便于阅读未逐一画出通用授权依赖
  管理员不直接确认、拒绝或取消订单
end note

note bottom of Scheduler
  任务以当前方案编号和有效截止为准
  页面请求同样复核截止，不等待扫描
  本图箭头表示调用依赖，不表示独立网络服务
end note
@enduml
